  "strategy": "T'Challa makes a tapped Vibranium token every time he enters or attacks, and every artifact spell of mana value 4 or more puts two +1/+1 counters on him, so the deck ramps on Sol Ring, Thran Dynamo, Gilded Lotus and the Vibranium tokens into big artifacts and suits him up. Hammer of Nazahn, the Spear of Bashenga, Vibranium Strike Gauntlets, Panther Habit, Whispersilk Cloak and Helm of the Host turn him into one threat aimed at the monarch, while Okoye, Queen Mother Ramonda, Palace Jailer and Throne of the High City take the crown, and Ramonda keeps small attackers off you while you hold it. Shuri draws off a wide artifact board, Metalwork Colossus comes down cheap behind it, and Vanquish the Horde, Generous Gift, Beast Within, Dispatch and Martial Coup answer the table.",
  "signature": [
    {
      "card_id": "t_challa_the_black_panther",
      "why": "Every attack makes a Vibranium token, and every big artifact spell is two +1/+1 counters on the commander."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "okoye_mighty_and_adored",
      "why": "Takes the crown on entry, and the creature she grows strikes twice with trample at the monarch."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "hammer_of_nazahn",
      "why": "Every Equipment that enters attaches for free, and the wearer is indestructible."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "shuri_the_black_panther",
      "why": "Lifelink, a card on every attack with three artifacts, and +2/+2 for the team with six."
    }
  ],
